@startuml
title 接收 HKICL 派发与退票处理流程 / HKICL Presentment & Return Flow

participant HKICL as "HKICL\n(派发文件)"
participant System as "Bank System\n(入库/判定/退票)"
participant Core as "Core Banking\n(账户状态与可用余额查询)"
participant Ops as "Operations / Manual Review\n(人工复核与授权)"
participant Collecting as "Collecting Bank\n(代收行/客户通知)"

HKICL -> System : Presentment File (images + metadata)\n(午夜派发，按付款行分箱)
activate System

System -> System : Ingest & bucket by payee/payer\n存储并按付款行分箱
System -> System : Auto-signature verification (score)\n自动验印并打分

alt signature_confidence low
  System -> Ops : Create manual review task\n人工复核任务（含影像与 OCR）
  Ops -> System : Review result & authorization\n人工审批/授权（含注释）
end

System -> Core : Query account status & balance\n实时查账户状态/余额/止付
Core --> System : Account status / balance / stop-pay flags

System -> System : Payability decision (rules engine)\n判定可否付款（自动/人工结果/账户状态）
alt payable
  System -> System : Add to settlement queue\n纳入待结算池
else not_payable
  System -> System : Assign return_reason code\n生成退票理由码
  System -> System : Generate IRD Return File (images + return data)\n生成退票影像包与数据（IRD）
  System -> HKICL : Send IRD Image Return File (before return cutoff)\n回送给 HKICL（退票截止前）
  System -> Collecting : Notify collecting bank & sync return result\n同步退票结果给代收行
  Collecting -> Customer : Send e-return notice\n代收行通知客户并发电子退票通知书
end

deactivate System
@enduml
